From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AztecBot <tech@aztec-labs.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:54:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: refresh compile_failure snapshots for the rc.2
 associated-item diagnostic

noir-lang/noir#13666 replaces "Could not resolve 'X' in path" with
"no associated item named \`X\` found for \`T\`" plus a secondary label on
the path segment. Six compile_failure stderr snapshots capture that
diagnostic; the assertions themselves are unchanged.

diff --git a/noir-projects/contract-snapshots/tests/snapshots/compile_failure/panic_on_incorrectly_performed_private_call/snapshots__stderr.snap b/noir-projects/contract-snapshots/tests/snapshots/compile_failure/panic_on_incorrectly_performed_private_call/snapshots__stderr.snap
