+++ b/noir-projects/contract-snapshots/tests/snapshots/compile_failure/panic_on_incorrectly_performed_private_call/snapshots__stderr.snap
@@ -2,14 +2,14 @@
 source: tests/snapshots.rs
 expression: stderr
 ---
-error: Could not resolve 'ZERO' in path
+error: no associated item named `ZERO` found for `AztecAddress`
   ┌─ src/main.nr:3:1
   │
 3 │ #[aztec]
   │ -------- While running this function attribute
   ·
 9 │         PanicOnIncorrectlyPerformedPrivateCall::at(AztecAddress::ZERO).arbitrary_external_function();
-  │                                                                  ----
+  │                                                                  ---- a path can only name an associated type, constant or function of `AztecAddress`
   │
 
 error: Your private call needs to be passed into the `self.call(...)` method to be executed (e.g. `self.call(MyContract::at(address).my_private_function(...args))`
